{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2659, "text": "Oh, that's terrible."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 5320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4320, "text": "What is it, Bull?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 9920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5840, "text": "A biker was beaten badly by a rival gang\nmember over at the Central Park Tennis"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 11440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9920, "text": "Court. In straight sets?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13680, "text": "Hi, guys!"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 17640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15220, "text": "Hey, Miss Holmes. Guess who just got\ninto town?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 19380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18260, "text": "Skipper Alan Hale?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 22680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21340, "text": "I can dream, can't I?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 26100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23440, "text": "Noble, it's Heather, my roommate from\ncollege."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 27980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26420, "text": "Hey, so what brings old Heather by?"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 31660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28260, "text": "Well, she just flew in to host a seminar\nupstate on motifs of death in Russian"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 32659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31660, "text": "literature."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 35360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33420, "text": "Sounds like a real party animal."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 40000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36600, "text": "No, you are really going to like her.\nShe's so sweet and she has a wonderful"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 41000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40000, "text": "personality."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 42480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41200, "text": "She's a schnauzer."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 47780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44400, "text": "Oh, here she comes. Now, please, guys,\nplease be nice to her."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 49740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48000, "text": "It's not like I'm asking you to fall at\nher feet."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 51480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50480, "text": "Christine, hi!"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 102170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98570, "text": "Anna Karenina says, 20 locals famous in\nKiev."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 105150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103390, "text": "That's a little wacky muscovite."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 110730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106110, "text": "Heather, I want to thank you for a\nreally fabulous lunch. I had a wonderful"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 112470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110730, "text": "time. I paid for it."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 115810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112790, "text": "120 bucks. Yeah, thanks, babe. Hot dogs\nwith me next time. Okay, good."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 120910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118650, "text": "Well, I guess we better get the session\nstarted."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 124070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121190, "text": "Yeah, that's how I went in there and\nmade the streets safer for our children."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 126490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124310, "text": "Speaking of which, if you ever decide to\nhave any out of wedlock."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 132490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131490, "text": "I'm scoring."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 139270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136330, "text": "Miss Sullivan, why don't you take\nHeather around the courtroom and make"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 142350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 139270, "text": "that she takes you up and shows you the\nback of my bench because a tour is"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 145450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142350, "text": "simply not a tour unless you've had a\ngood look at my seat."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 149910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148830, "text": "I'll see you later."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 151170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150170, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 153390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151550, "text": "Oh, they are so charming."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 155770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154050, "text": "So were Leopold and Loeb."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 163770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160430, "text": "This may be a little bit impetuous, but\nI was thinking of asking one of the guys"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 165530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163770, "text": "to come upstate with me this weekend."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 167730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166650, "text": "Harry or Dan?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 169210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168210, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 173410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 169370, "text": "Heather, that's not a little impetuous.\nThat's naughty."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 178730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 175750, "text": "Come on, Christine, this is the 80s."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 180350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178950, "text": "But you don't even know them."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 182990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180750, "text": "Did I tell you that Dan is a sex maniac?"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 187150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183989, "text": "Christine, you have always thought that\nevery guy was a sex maniac."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 189590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188590, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 194930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190690, "text": "Remember our sophomore year in college\nwhen you got so upset because that guy"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 196250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194930, "text": "asked to paint you naked?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 199510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198010, "text": "He was a house painter."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 203950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201830, "text": "All rise. This court is now in session."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 209230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206910, "text": "The Honorable and Sexy."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 213750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212750, "text": "Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 215090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213790, "text": "Objection. Overruled."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 222270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220410, "text": "Okay, take a seat and sit upon it."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 227830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223550, "text": "What do you got, Macaroni? Uh, first\ncase, sir. People versus Sheena."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 232930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231110, "text": "She's charged with prostitution."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 234610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233610, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 236350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235350, "text": "Okay,"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 239130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237310, "text": "you don't think that Dan is a sex\nmaniac?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 240450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239450, "text": "You watch this."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 246350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242770, "text": "Ready, Your Honor? Mr. Prosecutor. Yes,\nsir. The defendant was arrested in Times"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 247350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246350, "text": "Square. She has a prize."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 248930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247550, "text": "Prosecution recommends the maximum."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 250650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249650, "text": "Defense?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 252530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251530, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 256510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255030, "text": "Don't you have anything else to say?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 258250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257250, "text": "About what?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 262870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259170, "text": "About what? Oh, come on. Her chest, her\nbust, her zoomers."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 267950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266950, "text": "What did I say?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 271930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269370, "text": "Oh, come on. Her chest, her bust, her\nzoomers."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 276790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275790, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 279450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277730, "text": "Miss Sullivan, the plea."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 282010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279790, "text": "Uh, yeah, Your Honor, my client pleads\nguilty."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 284110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282250, "text": "Fine, $50 fine and time served."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 285410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284410, "text": "Ross?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 287330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286050, "text": "Come on, honey, let's go."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 288850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287850, "text": "Zoom, zoom, zoom."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 292330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291290, "text": "Hey, you guys."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 296750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292950, "text": "I have thoroughly enjoyed watching you\nin action, but I have to go."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 299810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296970, "text": "Can't you stick around a little while\nlonger? We got a window washer charged"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 300810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299810, "text": "with streaking."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 310610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309130, "text": "I really have to go. I have to get ready\nfor tonight."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 314290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311670, "text": "Oh, actually... Yes?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 320550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316470, "text": "I've been invited to Roland Jeffries'\nparty in Soho tonight. Why don't you"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 321429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320550, "text": "come along?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 322690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321430, "text": "Roland Jeffries, the artist?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 324210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323030, "text": "Yeah. Sure, yeah."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 327150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324530, "text": "Great. Well, what time do you finish\nhere? About ten."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 329670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327710, "text": "Perfect. I'll pick you up later,\nChristine."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 331410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330410, "text": "See you guys."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 332710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331710, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 337170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335010, "text": "Look at the way she walks."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 342000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338780, "text": "Yeah, kind of takes the wrinkles out of\nthe old robe, you know?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 352500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349440, "text": "Are you two done mentally undressing my\nfriend?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 353820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352820, "text": "Hold it a sec."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 360480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357200, "text": "All right, I admit, she's very\nattractive, but Heather has flaws and"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 361960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360480, "text": "imperfections just like everyone else."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 363260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362260, "text": "Name one."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 365440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364440, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 367580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365900, "text": "She can be quite messy in the kitchen."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 372800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370580, "text": "Maybe we should just have her put to\nsleep."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 380100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375360, "text": "Then the actual truth of it is she can\nbe more than a little bit flighty. Do I"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 381160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380100, "text": "detect a note of jealousy?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 382720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381560, "text": "No, no, it's true."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 385180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383480, "text": "You know what she even said to me about\nyou two?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 389260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385700, "text": "She said that she might consider taking\none of you two guys upstate with her for"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 390239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389260, "text": "the weekend."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 391460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390240, "text": "Is that flighty or what?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 407830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405550, "text": "I'd give the prosecution a chance to\nhose down."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 415030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411710, "text": "I am ashamed of you acting like a\nrutting pig."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 417330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416330, "text": "I gotta be me."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 422690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420250, "text": "You don't see Judge Stone behaving that\nway, do you?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 438430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435390, "text": "There's a melody in your heart. Hey,\nit's wonderful."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 440650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439650, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 443190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441250, "text": "So you finished the Morris file?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 446410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443610, "text": "No, but the execution's not till\ntomorrow night. We've got plenty of"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 450470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447810, "text": "Just kidding. There's no death penalty\nin New York."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 451870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450790, "text": "Yeah, I'm well aware of that."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 455210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452370, "text": "Dan, I want you to look over these\nprobation files before you leave."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 461210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460210, "text": "You must be kidding."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 462350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461350, "text": "No, I'm not."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 465180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463040, "text": "How is it? It'll take at least an hour.\nWhat about the party?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 468000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465440, "text": "A job worth doing is worth doing well."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 470820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469820, "text": "That's sick."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 473280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471780, "text": "You got a problem, Fielding?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 478720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475740, "text": "I don't have a problem."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 493810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492810, "text": "So what's on your mind?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 496110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494550, "text": "I can't tell you. Why not?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 499890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496810, "text": "Because you're a judge and I'm an\nattorney working in your court. So?"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 503830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500350, "text": "So I can't very well sit here and tell\nyou that I think you're a sneaky, skinny"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 505050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503830, "text": "little twerp, can I?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 508070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506770, "text": "I see your dilemma."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 511110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509510, "text": "Dan, what the hell is bugging you?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 515270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511750, "text": "You'll find me in contempt and throw me\nin jail. Oh, come on."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 518049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517049, "text": "Okay, okay."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 523230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519549, "text": "I think you're... You're abusing your\nauthority over me because you're afraid"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 525610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523230, "text": "a little man -to -man competition for\nHeather."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 530910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529910, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 533650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531630, "text": "I am? Yeah, I'm going to throw you in\njail."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 538130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536210, "text": "Dan, I think an apology is in order."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 539770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538590, "text": "Never. Dan."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 541150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540150, "text": "Very well."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 542730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541730, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 548530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546190, "text": "I mean that I should apologize to you."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 551180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549310, "text": "Dan. Well, you should!"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 555520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552680, "text": "This is an outrage! Don't push it,\nFielding. Right."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 562540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557760, "text": "Hey, all right. Maybe I did let\ncompetition color my actions a little"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 567680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562740, "text": "forget the files, forget the robe.\nForget that I'm a judge and that you're"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 572020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567680, "text": "a lowly subordinate whose very fate\nhangs on my whim."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 575400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573820, "text": "You make it so easy, sir."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 577320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576000, "text": "I'm serious, Dan, okay?"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 580230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579230, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 584790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581690, "text": "You know, it's really funny, isn't it? I\nmean, here we are. We're acting like a"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 587510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584790, "text": "couple of high school kids fighting over\nthe same girl."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 589270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588270, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 591350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589490, "text": "Drop her, bozo. Not for a geek like you."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 594550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593550, "text": "Well, all right, then."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 596750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595650, "text": "May the best man win."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 598710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597710, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 600150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599070, "text": "May the best man win."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 644020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640400, "text": "telling who could be here. Rock stars,\npoliticians, novelists."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 645420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644420, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 649180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647340, "text": "The cast from Motel Hell."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 652740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651340, "text": "Heather, darling."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 654200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653200, "text": "Roland, hello."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 656220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655040, "text": "More friends."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 659100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657000, "text": "I barely got to know her the first\nbatch."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 660600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659380, "text": "They're so amusing."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 665380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661480, "text": "This one keeps asking me when we're\ngoing to bob for things."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 670060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665820, "text": "and I keep telling him we don't bob for\nthings at my parties."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 671960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670700, "text": "This is Jeffrey Smith."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 678340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672200, "text": "This is such a bold piece. I love it.\nThis far exceeds any pre -Columbian art"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 679340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678340, "text": "have ever seen."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 688560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685820, "text": "What a silly goose I am."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 691480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689920, "text": "A madly silly goose."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 698260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696520, "text": "I've never seen you before in my life,\nokay?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 699560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698560, "text": "Yeah, but I'm positive."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 702880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699960, "text": "Mac, what's the problem? Oh, this guy\nswears he's met me before."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 704940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703160, "text": "So? In a former life."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 709380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706280, "text": "Aha. He was the king of Mesopotamia."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 712400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709760, "text": "I swear, I never forget a face."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 716960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713520, "text": "Say, isn't that Shirley MacLaine\nhovering over the cheese dip?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 722720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717500, "text": "Well, I guess I better be going."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 725280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723500, "text": "Enjoy the shindig. Yeah."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 727860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726280, "text": "Loved your sweater vest."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 730500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728960, "text": "I knew that you would."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 736600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734120, "text": "Roland, this looks like a wonderful\nparty."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 739780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736860, "text": "Yes, there is a little magic in the air\ntonight."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 744860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740300, "text": "Well, speaking of magic, what's that\nbehind your ear? Ow!"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 746860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745760, "text": "An earring."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 764010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762710, "text": "ever do that again."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 769470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767370, "text": "So the slide between the legs is out\nthen, huh?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 774050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771770, "text": "If I go down, I'm taking you with me."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 781470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777730, "text": "Is anyone hungry? I'll get us some\nappetizers. Well, I'll come with you."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 783570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781470, "text": "we can both find something to nibble on."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 788590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786590, "text": "Christine, why don't you show Harry your\nnew dress?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 791530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790530, "text": "So you got a new dress?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 792970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791730, "text": "Yep. So let's see it."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 804130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798310, "text": "You don't like it."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 806570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804710, "text": "Well, not really you."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 808610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807610, "text": "Yes, it is."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 816650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810270, "text": "That part is, but the whole thing is\nkind of, I don't know, it's kind of"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 817990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816650, "text": "daring, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 823000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818870, "text": "Listen, I will have you know that I'm\nnot the... prude everyone thinks I am."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 824720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823160, "text": "Hey, I know you."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 827440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825740, "text": "Pompeii, 79 A .D."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 832520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827800, "text": "You know, not many women would jump into\na live volcano rather than lose their"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 833520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832520, "text": "virginity."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 840540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838500, "text": "Old habits die hard, huh?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 846620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842760, "text": "So the doctor says, oh, there's my\nthermometer, so where did I leave my"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 859770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858350, "text": "Do you recognize that song?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 863830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860310, "text": "Oh, Time Goes By from Casablanca. That's\nmy favorite movie."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 865529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864630, "text": "Mine, too."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 866530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865530, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 869070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867590, "text": "I'm waiting till they colorize it."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 875390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871510, "text": "Dan doesn't see many movies that don't\nhave the word cheerleader in the title."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 877729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876950, "text": "He does."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 879610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877730, "text": "I think they're playing our song."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 887450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885930, "text": "So, uh, those are new, aren't they?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 904240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899980, "text": "Yeah, I guess I've always felt like I\nbelonged in the 40s. It was a simpler"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 906600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904240, "text": "with simpler tastes, simpler values."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 910140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907180, "text": "I guess that sort of makes me a...\nSimpleton."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 915040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912120, "text": "I never maimed anybody with that trick\nbefore."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 918020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917020, "text": "Where was I?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 919540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918200, "text": "The 40s."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 921300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919980, "text": "The 40s."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 927240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922020, "text": "That was another era. It was an age of\ninnocence. It was a time when any..."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 934400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927660, "text": "Wacky, crazy guy and gal could find each\nother on a crowded dance floor."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 944140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942820, "text": "Bad example."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 948980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946480, "text": "So tell me about yourself, Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 951740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950380, "text": "Who am I, Heather?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 954540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952600, "text": "Well, I guess..."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 959910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955210, "text": "I'm the kind of guy that has a shoebox\nfull of file cards with all the"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 962410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959910, "text": "information on every member of the Tommy\nDorsey Orchestra."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 965910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962930, "text": "Date of birth, favorite foods, hobbies,\nyou name it."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 967730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966730, "text": "Me?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 974490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969670, "text": "I'm the kind of guy that goes to the\nsupermarket and hears a delightful"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 979130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974490, "text": "ditty on the Muzak and I just click my\nheels together right there in the"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 981350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979130, "text": "section and I don't care who sees me."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 984150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983150, "text": "Me?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 995080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988540, "text": "I'm the sort of Joe that likes to get up\nreal early on a Sunday and go down to"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 998420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995080, "text": "the docks to watch him unload the fish."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1001880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000520, "text": "You get the picture?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1004000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003000, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1012180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1009540, "text": "Oh, God, she's so exciting."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1013840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012840, "text": "Yeah, right."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1015959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014959, "text": "Exciting, bold."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1021080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016620, "text": "You know, I have always felt like I'm in\nthat woman's shadow."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1027040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021980, "text": "I know it's ridiculous, but there have\nbeen times when I felt completely"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1028200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027040, "text": "when I was around her."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1031740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029800, "text": "I'm going to go break in on them right\nnow."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1036200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033900, "text": "Yeah, that's the feeling."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1038140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036960, "text": "All right, cut in."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1039640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038640, "text": "Why, certainly."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1043260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041500, "text": "I should warn you, I was..."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1044560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043560, "text": "Pretty charming."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1046740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044599, "text": "Yeah, well, two can play at that game."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1052580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050760, "text": "Heather? Yes, Dan?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1056900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054340, "text": "I haven't worn underwear since 1968."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1062820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060400, "text": "I must show them to you. They're right\nover here."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1065200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063240, "text": "Oh, my God, they're gone."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1070060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066000, "text": "What's gone? My priceless collection of\nantique porcelain eggs."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1093590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091590, "text": "Picked me to go away with her this week?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1094810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093810, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1098770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095430, "text": "Lord, I was waiting for someone to stop\nthe shrieking."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1102510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100450, "text": "You picked him over me?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1106590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103170, "text": "What? Who the hell said I was deciding\nbetween you and Dan?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1115310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109890, "text": "Roland, could you show me to the powder\nroom? Yes, we are beating up a bit,"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1116330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115330, "text": "aren't we?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1121760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118640, "text": "gonna go get something for us to toast\nwith. Don't you go anywhere, my little"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1123040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121760, "text": "love monkey."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1130200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123560, "text": "I cannot believe that you would reject\nme for someone"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1131620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130200, "text": "like Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1135320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131960, "text": "Worse, you rejected me for Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1141120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136000, "text": "Is that what you like? A man who is\ndisgusting and sleazy?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1145760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141600, "text": "Well, listen, I can be disgusting and\nsleazy."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1152830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150670, "text": "Please don't feel badly. I think you're\nadorable."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1158470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153650, "text": "It's just that I find myself more in\nsync with Dan. Yeah, well, a sync is"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1164390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158470, "text": "one of the places you'll find yourself\nin sync. All right, sit down."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1170210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168930, "text": "I don't know what to say."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1175730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170850, "text": "Dan is just more my type. I don't know\nhow to describe it. He's just more"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1178070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175730, "text": "contemporary. Hey, I'm contemporary?"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1182700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178870, "text": "Yes, you are. in a time warp sort of\nway."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1187440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184440, "text": "Well, I'm sure you mean that in the\nreally nicest sense."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1188940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187800, "text": "Oh, absolutely."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1193680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189420, "text": "You are the sweetest, most sentimental,\nterrific guy."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1197600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194820, "text": "It's just that you're not right for me."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1200640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199480, "text": "No hard feelings?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1206700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205180, "text": "No, no hard feelings."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1208200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207200, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1212940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208560, "text": "Because, Harry, you're a very special\nguy. And you need someone very special."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1216600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213660, "text": "And you never know when that right\nperson may come along."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1229020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228020, "text": "Want to dance?"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1272370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271230, "text": "they're the geeks."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1273870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272870, "text": "I mean it."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1277690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274330, "text": "I'm glad things worked out this way,\nbecause now you and I have some time"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1282090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277690, "text": "together to talk, find out about each\nother, you know?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1288350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282890, "text": "I mean, let's face it. Are these really\nthe kind of people that we would want as"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1289350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288350, "text": "friends?"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1291130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289750, "text": "Excuse me, is anybody sitting here?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1305240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302960, "text": "Yes, I am. Hi, I'm Christine Sullivan."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1306520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305520, "text": "Nice to meet you."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1309300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308300, "text": "Who's the geek?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1311880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309680, "text": "Oh, you'll have to forgive him. He's a\nlittle dazed."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1315480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312160, "text": "I see. Well, is anybody sitting here?\nNo."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1320620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316280, "text": "Great, because I want to take this chair\nover there. Hey, that Dan Fielding, I"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1325320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320620, "text": "tell you, I can't remember when I met a\nmore fun, interesting guy in my entire"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1327340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325320, "text": "life. He's terrific. Well, bye."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1337670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336270, "text": "I know just how you must be."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1339410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338410, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1342910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341350, "text": "look at the bright side."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1344850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343590, "text": "Things couldn't get worse."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1346049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345110, "text": "Hey, everybody."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1347370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346050, "text": "Mel's got to catch a plane."}
